#23000
Zone Room -   The Perceptory~
   This zone is made by Brighteyes on Raven Mud, 1998.  It describes the siege
of papal forces on a small perceptory where the Knight Templars have stashed
away relics and treasure to save it from the greed of the French King and the
Pope.    
~
230 0 0 0 0 0 255 0
S
#23001
The tomb of the slain Grandmaster~
   You have arrived in a room all painted in black and silver.  In the middle
of the room you see a large coffin surrounded by three large chandelers and on
it a silver plate with the inscription I.  B.  M is fastened.  In the east
there is an altar upon which lies an open Bible and 9 lighted candles.  In the
air you can feel a weak smell of incense adding to the mystic feel of this
room.    
~
