#23003
The shrine~
   You have arrived to a small chapel, painted all in gold and blue.  The
ceiling is painted to look like the open sky on a starbright night, and the
floor is chequered with alternating white and black squares.  In the east you
see an altar upon which there is an open Bible and three lit candles.  Inset in
the floor is a blazing 6-pointed star, and directly above it you can see an oil
lamp suspended from the ceiling.    
~
