#23004
Passage of death~
   This dark passage is far to small to contain more than one person at the
time, the air is stale and hard to breathe, to the point where you almost feel
like you are suffocating.  Going through it might be a tight squeeze but you
feel confident that you will make it through.  Next to the door is an
inscription in both English and Latin.    
~
