stained glass windows light is pouring down upon those gathered here in solemn
worship of the one allmighty God.  Here in the center there is a huge bronze
plate with an inscription, and the floor is tiled with alternating white and
black marble squares.  Standing here you feel an inner peace and you feel the
power surge through you.    
