E
ceiling painting mural picture history~
In this mural you see the last Grand Master of the Knight Templars being burned 
at the stake on an Island in the Seine, 1314 after denying the charges laid on him
during the mock trial staged by Philip IV. With his last dying breath he spells
out a terrible curse stating that within a year after his death he will stand 
before the throne of God, together with Clement V the Pope, and Philip IV the King
where God will pass judgement upon them. Within a year both of them are dead...
~
S
