Yun's Abode~
   You have entered the small comfortable abode of Yun.  Whenever Yun is not
busy elsewhere she tries to spend her time here, recuperating after a hard days
work.  The room is painted in all bright colours picturing a small forest glen.
When you listen carefully you hear faint noises like ones you can hear on a
bright summers day.  In one of the corners you see a comfortable bed and on the
desk that is standing in the shade under an oaktree you see a large tome where
Yun keeps a record of all that she is doing, and what she plans on doing.    
